<!--Post: 4819--><!--Time: 1106764278-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4819"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Dpinva<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Dpinva<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 10:31 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><u><b><i>&#34;George, they didn&#39;t release it.&#34;</i></b></u> <BR> <BR>Tom, dare we ask what your source was? Without giving up names, sources or methods can you give us <i>some idea </i>of where this came from and how reliable it is?  <BR> <BR><i>Thanks</i>!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
