<!--Post: 4837--><!--Time: 1106769034-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4837"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 11:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dpinva: Tom has great sources, it&#39;s one of his most pronounced strengths. I&#39;m pretty sure I have an accurate, <u>generalized</u> hunch as to the source for this but am saying nothing. Tom will let us know if he can name names, which at present, I doubt he can.  <BR> <BR>I can&#39;t resist: The two &#34;other&#34; BTK places, at least as of last night, were whining about Tom having this information, which of course <b>they didn&#39;t</b> have. Tom went through half a year of severe crap to promote this site and he&#39;s trumped the entire Internet! &#34;Who&#39;s Sorry Now?&#34; as the song goes.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
