<!--Post: 4864--><!--Time: 1106780257-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4864"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 2:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text--><b>Time to be exceptionally self-absorbed, even for me. UNTIL BTK PROVIDES MINUTE, ONLY-THE-KILLER-WOULD KNOW INFORMATION ABOUT OTHER POSSIBLE VICTIMS, LET&#39;S NOT CONCEDE MS. HEDGE, MS. DAVIS OR SHERRY BAKER TO BTK JUST YET.</b> <BR> <BR>Thanks! Foxtrotmom, Hi. I know you&#39;re not giving these ladies to BTK. This is merely a message I&#39;ve touched on in the past. It&#39;s interesting: BTK, right now, has as much exposure and interest as he has had since the Wegerle bombshell last March. I know BTK needs to be the one to control the pace of everything but really, this is a great time for BTK to provide the minute details of any other past deeds. I wouldn&#39;t take a cereal box in a certain location as proof of <i>anything.</i> Until intimate, detailed information is provided, I say BTK&#39;s victims are: Oteros, Brights, Vian, Fox and Wegerle <b>ONLY</b>, along with a letter to Ms. Williams. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
